  "description": "消费者下单 → 订单审核(地址/库存/风控) → 库存分配(就近仓库/跨仓调拨) → 拆单决策(一单多品是否拆) → 拣货→包装→出库扫描 → 揽收→中转→派送→签收 → 履约完成；模拟截单时间从 15:00 延长到 23:00，讨论后端作业压力与消费者体验的权衡",
  "deps": ["CH4-003"],
  "params": [
    { "key": "cutoff_time", "label": "截单时间", "type": "enum", "default": "17:00", "options": [ { "label": "15:00", "value": "15:00" }, { "label": "17:00", "value": "17:00" }, { "label": "20:00", "value": "20:00" }, { "label": "23:00", "value": "23:00" } ], "description": "当日发货截止时间" },
    { "key": "allocation_strategy", "label": "多仓库存分配策略", "type": "enum", "default": "nearest", "options": [ { "label": "就近", "value": "nearest" }, { "label": "就全", "value": "full" }, { "label": "就廉", "value": "cheap" } ], "description": "分配策略" },
    { "key": "split_strategy", "label": "拆单策略", "type": "enum", "default": "by_warehouse", "options": [ { "label": "不拆", "value": "none" }, { "label": "按仓拆", "value": "by_warehouse" }, { "label": "按品类拆", "value": "by_category" } ], "description": "拆单影响履约和成本" },
    { "key": "sla_target", "label": "目标履约SLA", "type": "float", "min": 0.95, "max": 0.999, "step": 0.001, "default": 0.98, "description": "目标履约准时率" },
    { "key": "cancel_window", "label": "退货拦截时间窗", "type": "int", "unit": "小时", "min": 0, "max": 24, "step": 1, "default": 2, "description": "发货后多久可拦截退货" }
  ],
  "outputs": [
